      },
      "message": "fix(build): keep Cargo.lock intact in web/build-app-wasm.sh\n\nThe script's flecs --config patch makes cargo rewrite the workspace\nCargo.lock (flecs_ecs / flecs_ecs_sys lose source and checksum). The EXIT\nrestore trap existed but was set after the first cargo calls. The tracked\nlock is now saved before any cargo call and restored by the trap on\nsuccess, failure and Ctrl-C, and the header says so.\n\nFixes #949\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
